-- Grammar content migration generated by scripts/grammar-topics-from-json.mjs on 2026-09-06T07:45:57.221Z.
--
-- Creates 4 new grammar topic(s):
--   - adjective-endings-intro (topic_order 9): 9 rule(s), 10 example(s), 26 exercise(s)
--   - pronouns-accusative-dative (topic_order 10): 9 rule(s), 10 example(s), 26 exercise(s)
--   - modal-verbs-past (topic_order 11): 9 rule(s), 10 example(s), 26 exercise(s)
--   - temporal-prepositions (topic_order 12): 9 rule(s), 10 example(s), 26 exercise(s)
--
